@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
# JWT + RBAC: access token de un usuario con la concesión (401 sin token, 403 sin permiso).
@token = <access_token>

### create: liquida una recolección -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/settlements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "collectionId": 1,
  "notes": "Pago en efectivo"
}

### create: la recolección ya está liquidada -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/settlements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "collectionId": 1
}

### getAll / getOne (con la recolección y sus pesajes)
GET {{baseUrl}}/settlements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/settlements/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### verify: recalcula y compara con lo guardado
GET {{baseUrl}}/settlements/1/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### PATCH: solo notas -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/settlements/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Pago por transferencia"
}

### un pesaje de una recolección liquidada no se puede modificar -> 409
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/weighings/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tareKg": 1
}

### delete de una liquidación emitida -> 409
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/settlements/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### void (lógico): anula y reabre la recolección -> 200
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/settlements/1/void
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### delete de una liquidación anulada (físico) -> 200
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/settlements/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
